WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is a real
"time flies" situation for me

00:00:01.701 --> 00:00:03.003 size:75% position:38%
that you're starting
your fifth season.

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:06.406
Because I remember when you were
there on your first day.

00:00:06.406 --> 00:00:08.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's crazy
that it's been five years.

00:00:08.141 --> 00:00:09.542 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's --
Yeah, it's long.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:11.077 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:11.077 --> 00:00:13.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you have Adam Driver.
You have Kanye West.

00:00:13.747 --> 00:00:14.748 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a very good
season premiere.

00:00:14.748 --> 00:00:16.750 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you feel good about that?
-Yeah, it's sick.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:17.751 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:17.751 --> 00:00:18.551 line:92%
-And Adam's hosted before.

00:00:18.551 --> 00:00:19.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm just, like,
happy to be there.

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:20.587 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're still --
So that's good.

00:00:20.587 --> 00:00:21.654 align:start size:94% position:6%
Five years in,
you're happy to be there.

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:23.823 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. 'Cause, like,
I don't deserve to be there.

00:00:23.823 --> 00:00:24.858 align:start size:94% position:6%
so, like, I just --
[ Laughter ]

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:26.393 align:start size:94% position:6%
I feel like I'm getting away
with something.

00:00:26.393 --> 00:00:28.461 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You definitely
deserve to be here.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:30.930
What is your -- You know,
we're late in the week.

00:00:30.930 --> 00:00:31.531 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
We're Thursday.

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:33.266
So Tuesday night is, of course,
writing night.

00:00:33.266 --> 00:00:34.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
What is your writing-night
process like?

00:00:34.934 --> 00:00:39.105
-Well, usually everybody there
stays and works really hard.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.740 align:start size:94% position:6%
Um...
[ Laughter ]

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.109 align:start size:94% position:6%
I, uh --
I come in for two, three hours

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:46.212 align:start size:94% position:6%
and talk to the one writer
that'll deal with me.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:46.746 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:46.746 --> 00:00:49.949
And then just -- I'm like,
"Is that --" and I leave.

00:00:49.949 --> 00:00:50.483 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:53.386 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you bring something
to the table, historically?

00:00:53.386 --> 00:00:54.187 line:92%
Do you feel like you have ideas?

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:58.892 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, I bring it to the table,
but they don't like it.

00:00:58.892 --> 00:01:00.493 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.195 size:75% position:38% line:92%
But, like, I get it.

00:01:02.195 --> 00:01:05.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You had a lot of sketches
that are great.

00:01:05.131 --> 00:01:07.267 align:start size:94% position:6%
I always am drawn
to the stories about sketches

00:01:07.267 --> 00:01:09.135 align:start size:94% position:6%
that were maybe --
did not work perfectly.

00:01:09.135 --> 00:01:11.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
-Arm-wrestling with The Rock.

00:01:11.871 --> 00:01:12.639 size:84% position:42% line:92%
Tell me about that one.

00:01:12.639 --> 00:01:15.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh, yeah.
So I saw "Over The Top."

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:16.709 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah,
a Sylvester Stallone movie.

00:01:16.709 --> 00:01:20.280 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah. And, you know,
it's about arm-wrestling.

00:01:20.280 --> 00:01:21.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-And The Rock is very big,

00:01:21.648 --> 00:01:23.416 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, you know, I'm me.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:23.416 --> 00:01:26.419 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I figured it would be funny
if we arm-wrestled

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:28.721 align:start size:94% position:6%
and, like,
he ripped one arm off.

00:01:28.721 --> 00:01:32.125 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then he goes to walk away,
and I'm like,

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:33.393 size:88% position:44% line:92%
"No," like, "Other arm."

00:01:33.393 --> 00:01:35.261 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:35.261 --> 00:01:37.097 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, you know,
my son's there,

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:39.532
and he like, you know,
winks at me and all this.

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:41.167 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know,
everybody's on my side,

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:43.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then he just
rips my other arm off.

00:01:43.336 --> 00:01:44.170 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:46.573
But, yeah, just nobody --
-Nobody was behind that?

00:01:46.573 --> 00:01:49.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. And it was weird,
'cause, like, I was armless,

00:01:49.509 --> 00:01:53.513 align:start size:94% position:6%
and The Rock was like, "Aah!
Aaaah!"

00:01:53.513 --> 00:01:54.881 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And it was silent.

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:55.582 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.582 --> 00:01:57.550 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I just watched
my sketch bomb.

00:01:57.550 --> 00:02:00.487 align:start size:94% position:6%
-[ Laughs ] With no arms.
-With no arms.

00:02:00.487 --> 00:02:02.222 line:92%
-In an alternate universe --

00:02:02.222 --> 00:02:03.957 align:start size:94% position:6%
Obviously, in the universe
we live in,

00:02:03.957 --> 00:02:05.592 line:92%
Alec Baldwin plays Donald Trump.

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:07.560 align:start size:94% position:6%
There was -- you auditioned
for Donald Trump.

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.362
Everyone in the cast auditioned
for Donald Trump.

00:02:09.362 --> 00:02:10.630 size:78% position:39%
-Yeah, let me just --
Before you show --

00:02:10.630 --> 00:02:12.732 align:start size:94% position:6%
They made us all audition.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:14.934 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wasn't at home, like,
"Let's go."

00:02:14.934 --> 00:02:16.202 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You know what I mean?

00:02:16.202 --> 00:02:17.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, yeah.
-And so -- But there you are.

00:02:17.871 --> 00:02:20.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is a very rare photo.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:22.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, that is.
-And how was...

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:25.745 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Applause ]

00:02:25.745 --> 00:02:27.080 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
Thank you, everybody.

00:02:27.080 --> 00:02:29.883 align:start size:94% position:6%
-How was your Trump?
Be honest.

00:02:29.883 --> 00:02:30.750 line:92%
-You know, I didn't even --

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
I was so upset
that I had to do it,

00:02:32.852 --> 00:02:33.853 align:start size:94% position:6%
it was just very --
it was very bad.

00:02:33.853 --> 00:02:36.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
-By the way, he's upset
that he has to be president,

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:37.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
so that might have --
-Yeah.

00:02:37.724 --> 00:02:38.758 line:92%
-You could've pulled from that.

00:02:38.758 --> 00:02:41.761 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What a [bleep] dork.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:41.761 --> 00:02:43.263 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm sorry.
-That's all right.

00:02:43.263 --> 00:02:46.499 align:start size:94% position:6%
Please, we're on very late.
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.968 align:start size:94% position:6%
You -- since I last --
you were last on the show,

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:49.936 align:start size:94% position:6%
you got engaged.
Congratulations.

00:02:49.936 --> 00:02:51.938 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did. Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:51.938 --> 00:02:54.674 align:start size:94% position:6%
All right.
Thank you very much.

00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:57.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We have talked -- I believe
we talked on this show

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.846 align:start size:94% position:6%
about how back in the day,
you would just

00:02:59.846 --> 00:03:01.981 align:start size:94% position:6%
leave your door open,
and your friends would have

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:04.517
sort of carte blanche to come
over and crash on your couch.

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:05.385 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Is there now a --

00:03:05.385 --> 00:03:06.719 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That day is over.
-That's over. Okay.

00:03:06.719 --> 00:03:08.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I am not friends
with them no more.

00:03:08.188 --> 00:03:10.089 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just fully wrote them off
as friends?

00:03:10.089 --> 00:03:10.623 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was not safe?

00:03:10.623 --> 00:03:12.825 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's the best thing about
your life getting better.

00:03:12.825 --> 00:03:15.695
You just don't have to hang out
with those people anymore.

00:03:15.695 --> 00:03:17.697 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:17.697 --> 00:03:19.199 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What? No.

00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:20.600 size:78% position:39% line:92%
What, am I gonna lie?

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.403 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you think they knew
as soon as you got engaged

00:03:23.403 --> 00:03:25.238 align:start size:94% position:6%
that it was over for them?
-Oh [bleep] yeah.

00:03:25.238 --> 00:03:26.639 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:03:26.639 --> 00:03:27.507 line:92%
-Yeah, I called one of my boys.

00:03:27.507 --> 00:03:30.343
He was like, "I knew it.
Best of luck," then he hung up.

00:03:30.343 --> 00:03:32.111 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And that was it?
That was the end of it?

00:03:32.111 --> 00:03:32.845 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, yeah.

00:03:32.845 --> 00:03:38.284
-You guys have taken a big step
for a couple that is engaged.

00:03:38.284 --> 00:03:39.352 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
You bought a pet?

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:41.588 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, we got a pig.
-You got a pig.

00:03:41.588 --> 00:03:44.557 size:75% position:38%
-Yo, can I just say,
like, this girl --

00:03:44.557 --> 00:03:45.959 line:92%
She was like, "I want a pig."

00:03:45.959 --> 00:03:48.328 align:start size:94% position:6%
And then, an hour later,
it was just there.

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:48.995 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:48.995 --> 00:03:50.697 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know what I mean?
Like, I'm still trying to

00:03:50.697 --> 00:03:53.533 size:84% position:42%
