for the last two weeks.

00:03:53.533 --> 00:03:55.802 size:75% position:38%
This chick got a pig
in a [bleep] hour.

00:03:55.802 --> 00:03:58.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Does she just
say it to the universe

00:03:58.705 --> 00:03:59.572 size:84% position:42% line:92%
