00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:01.441 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, she was like,
"I want a pig,"

00:04:01.441 --> 00:04:04.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then it was there.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:04.644 --> 00:04:05.845 size:75% position:38% line:92%
It was [bleep] dope.

00:04:05.845 --> 00:04:08.915
-And pigs, of course,
are a hyper-intelligent animal.

00:04:08.915 --> 00:04:10.049 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Sure.
-This is --

00:04:10.049 --> 00:04:12.418 line:92%
But this is a Manhattan pig?

00:04:12.418 --> 00:04:14.988 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
Oh, it's a top bitch.

00:04:14.988 --> 00:04:16.756 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:18.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's a bougie pig.
-There you go.

00:04:18.558 --> 00:04:20.927 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's your bougie pig.
[ Audience "Awws" ]

00:04:20.927 --> 00:04:23.596 size:78% position:39%
-That's Piggy Smalls.
-That is not a joke.

00:04:23.596 --> 00:04:25.832
-Yeah.
-You named the pig Piggy Smalls.

00:04:25.832 --> 00:04:26.733 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:04:26.733 --> 00:04:28.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yeah.

00:04:28.668 --> 00:04:29.902 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-How old is the pig now?

00:04:29.902 --> 00:04:31.571 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know,
but it's big now.

00:04:31.571 --> 00:04:32.338 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:04:32.338 --> 00:04:35.008
-That was like a week ago, and
it's double, triple that now.

00:04:35.008 --> 00:04:38.745
-Do you -- Are you sort of
every day seeing why less --

00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:40.747 align:start size:94% position:6%
