and didn't move much.

00:04:44.984 --> 00:04:46.953 align:start size:94% position:6%
But then --
Now it's starting to bite.

00:04:46.953 --> 00:04:47.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Light laughter ]

00:04:47.820 --> 00:04:50.156 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Starting to do stuff like --
It's a pig.

00:04:50.156 --> 00:04:52.558 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-You know? They do that.

00:04:52.558 --> 00:04:53.793 size:88% position:44% line:92%
So, you know, I see why.

00:04:53.793 --> 00:04:55.228
-Well, it's interesting.
I feel like when you live

00:04:55.228 --> 00:04:58.097
