00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:05.171 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:05.171 --> 00:05:07.940 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You're all-in on the pig.
-I love it, yeah.

00:05:07.940 --> 00:05:10.176 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-I want it to get big and fat.

00:05:10.176 --> 00:05:12.945 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll walk it down --
-Well, I got good news, Pete.

00:05:12.945 --> 00:05:14.347 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:14.347 --> 00:05:18.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You have about 50 tattoos.
-Yeah.

00:05:18.151 --> 00:05:21.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And you already
got a tattoo of the pig.

00:05:21.387 --> 00:05:22.388 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Of course.
-There you go.

00:05:22.388 --> 00:05:23.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's your --
-Yeah, there it is.

00:05:23.423 --> 00:05:24.691 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There's your tattoo
of Piggy Smalls.

00:05:24.691 --> 00:05:26.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah.
[ Audience "Awws" ]

00:05:26.626 --> 00:05:29.028 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-That's fantastic.

00:05:29.028 --> 00:05:30.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
And now you're kind of --
I mean, now you're --

00:05:30.229 --> 00:05:32.565 size:78% position:39%
-Yeah, I don't think.
I just kind of do.

00:05:32.565 --> 00:05:33.633 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:33.633 --> 00:05:35.234
-Yeah.
-Well, that's, I think, the di--

00:05:35.234 --> 00:05:36.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's why you're great
