00:05:36.436 --> 00:05:38.237 align:start size:94% position:6%
because she can just
summon a pig,

00:05:38.237 --> 00:05:42.075 size:78% position:39% line:92%
and then you can just

00:05:40.907 --> 00:05:42.075 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, yeah.

